IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`
IMPORT fixtures

§ `Terms and Conditions Governing the PAssion POSB Debit Card 'Up to 9% Cash Rebates (18X yuu Points) Promotion'`

-- ===========================================================================
-- DOCUMENT. posb-passion-yuu-tnc: "Terms and Conditions Governing the PAssion
-- POSB Debit Card 'Up to 9% Cash Rebates (18X yuu Points) Promotion'",
-- "Updated as of 29 Apr 2026" on every page, cl.1-22 and Appendix 1 (DBS Bank
-- Ltd / POSB). THE PROMOTION IS LIVE: "valid from 1 October 2025 to 31 December
-- 2026" (cl.3). The edition at the old URL (posb-passion-yuu-tnc-2025, role
-- `historical`) ended on 30 September 2025; reading it alone is how the earlier
-- row of this subject came to mark PAssion `Source expired`. Guidance:
-- posb-passion-yuu-faq (updated as at 30 May 2025; it describes the yuu app and
-- card linking, and states no rate).
--
-- WHAT THE TEXT SAYS.
--   cl.1     For a holder of a PAssion POSB Debit Card (also the Platinum Debit and
--            HomeTeamNS-PAssion-POSB Debit) who has a People's Association
--            membership, a yuu Account, and has linked the card in the yuu App.
--   cl.4     "Qualified Spend": retail transactions charged to the PAssion Card in
--            the Promotion Period and posted; "only retail transactions charged to
--            Mastercard"; less refunds, pre-authorisations, fees, "bill payments via
--            internet banking", 30 MCCs and 16 description families.
--   cl.5     "Bonus Eligible Spend": (i) "Local currency spend made at
--            Participating Stores (subject to Exclusion List listed in APPENDIX 1)"
--            and (ii) "Retail spend as defined in Clause 10a".
--   cl.6     Participating Stores: DFI Retail Group (7-Eleven, Guardian);
--            MacroValue (Cold Storage, CS Fresh, Giant, Jasons Deli); Singtel
--            (SingtelShop! and Singtel Exclusive Retailers, "excluding Singtel
--            recurring bill payments"); Gojek Singapore; foodpanda Singapore (food
--            delivery, pick up, shops and pandamart); Charge+; CHAGEE.
--            SIMPLYGO IS NOT ON THE LIST (it is on the yuu Card's).
--   cl.8-9   Base Points: 3X yuu Points (1.5%) on every S$1 of Bonus Eligible
--            Spend at Participating Stores: "1X yuu Point from Participating
--            Stores" and "2X yuu Points from POSB". No minimum, no cap. "Retail
--            transactions made at the Participating Stores located outside of
--            Singapore and/or charged in foreign currencies are not eligible."
--   cl.10    POSB Bonus Points, per Qualifying Month (a calendar month): Tier 1
--            (Basic): charge a minimum of S$500 Qualified Spend and transact at a
--            minimum 3 of ten items (Malaysian Ringgit spend; Cold Storage / CS
--            Fresh / Jasons; Giant; Guardian; 7-Eleven; Singtel; Gojek; foodpanda;
--            Charge+; CHAGEE): 1.5% (3X) on Participating Stores spend, 3% (6X)
--            on Malaysian Ringgit spend, capped at S$10 or 2,000 yuu Points. Tier 2
--            (Supercharged): the same S$500 and a minimum 5 items: 7.5% (15X) and
--            9% (18X), capped at S$38 or 7,600 yuu Points. cl.10(b): Qualified
--            Spend aggregates across the cardholder's PAssion cards. cl.10(c):
--            foreign-currency retail "(except Malaysian Ringgit)" is not eligible.
--            cl.10(d): credited "within 90 days after each Qualifying Month".
--   cl.12    "All yuu Points are awarded up to 2 decimal places."
--   cl.13    Only posted transactions count.
--   App.1    The per-merchant exclusion list, and the closing statement that "DBS
--            will not award Bonus Rewards on transactions that do not earn Base
--            Rewards from yuu/Participating Stores, unless otherwise stated."
--
-- 18X IS A HEADLINE. Base 3X + Tier 2 Bonus 15X = 18X yuu Points per S$1 at a
-- Participating Store, or 5.04 miles at 0.28; the Tier 2 cap of 7,600 yuu Points
-- is S$506.67 of store spend at 15X.
--
-- THE FORKS.
--   F-passion-myr-base: Malaysian Ringgit spend is Bonus Eligible Spend by
--     cl.5(ii) but is not "at Participating Stores", and cl.9 grants Base Points
--     on Bonus Eligible Spend "made at Participating Stores". Reading 1: ringgit
--     spend earns only the Tier bonus (6X or 18X). Reading 2: it also earns the 3X
--     Base. Floor Reading 1, ceiling Reading 2.
--   F-singtel-base (as in yuu): Appendix 1 says Base Points "will not be awarded
--     for all in-stores and online purchases" at Singtel and lists only
--     corporate plans, prepaid top-up and bills as barred from the Bonus. Read with
--     the closing sentence, an ordinary Singtel Shop purchase earns the Bonus only
--     if "otherwise stated" applies. Floor 0, ceiling the Tier bonus.
--   F-bill-payments: Singtel "recurring bill payment and bill payment", settled
--     here by the row's own words for both Base and Bonus.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `cl.3 -- the Promotion Period`

GIVETH A DATE
`the PAssion Promotion starts` MEANS Date 1 10 2025

GIVETH A DATE
`the PAssion Promotion ends` MEANS Date 31 12 2026

-- Within the period by the date the transaction is charged and by the date it posts.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is inside the PAssion Promotion Period` p MEANS
    p's `date charged` AT LEAST `the PAssion Promotion starts`
    AND p's `date charged` AT MOST `the PAssion Promotion ends`
    AND p's `date posted` AT MOST `the PAssion Promotion ends`


§§ `cl.4 -- Qualified Spend`

-- cl.4(v): 4784, 4829, 4900, 6010, 6011, 6012, 6051, 6211, 6300, 6381, 6399,
-- 6540, 7523, 7995, 8062, 8211, 8220, 8241, 8244, 8249, 8299, 8398, 8661, 9211,
-- 9222, 9223, 9311, 9399, 9402, 9405.
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the PAssion excluded category codes` MEANS
    LIST 4784, 4829, 4900, 6010, 6011, 6012, 6051, 6211, 6300, 6381, 6399, 6540,
         7523, 7995, 8062, 8211, 8220, 8241, 8244, 8249, 8299, 8398, 8661, 9211,
         9222, 9223, 9311, 9399, 9402, 9405

GIVEN k IS A `Charge kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PAssion cl.4 excludes the kind` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `Retail purchase`                                   THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Bill payment`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`      THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Top-up of a prepaid card or stored-value account`  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Payment of funds to a payment service provider`    THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Instalment plan charge`                            THEN FALSE
    WHEN `My Preferred Payment Plan charge`                  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Cash advance`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Balance transfer or funds transfer`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Fee, interest or finance charge`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Pre-authorisation`                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Payment through UOB Payment Facility`              THEN FALSE
    WHEN `NETS or NETS-related transaction`                  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `SmartPay or personal loan`                         THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Transit-related transaction`                       THEN FALSE

-- cl.4(vi): AMAZE, AXS BizPay, AXS PTE LTD, BAGUS, CANTINE, EZLINK / EZ-LINK,
-- PAYPAL AXS PTE LTD, RAZERPAY, SAM PAYMENTS, SEDAP, Sgebiz / SGeBiz, SHOPEEPAY,
-- Singapore E-Business, SINGTEL DASH, TRANSIT, YOUTRIP.
GIVEN d IS A Descriptor
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PAssion cl.4(vi) names the description` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `Amaze`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `AXS`                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bagus`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cantine`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `EZ-Link`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `PayPal AXS Pte Ltd`     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Razerpay`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SAM`                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sedap`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sgebiz`                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `ShopeePay`              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singapore E-Business`   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singtel Dash`           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `TRANSIT`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Youtrip`                THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                          FALSE

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is PAssion Qualified Spend` p MEANS
    `the purchase is inside the PAssion Promotion Period` p
    AND p's `posting status` EQUALS `Posted to the account`
    AND NOT (`PAssion cl.4 excludes the kind` (p's `charge kind`))
    AND NOT (`the code is among` p `the PAssion excluded category codes`)
    AND NOT (`PAssion cl.4(vi) names the description` (p's descriptor))
    AND NOT (p's `later reversed`)


§§ `cl.6, Appendix 1 -- Participating Stores and what is carved out`

GIVEN who IS A Merchant
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the merchant is a PAssion Participating Store` who MEANS
    CONSIDER who
    WHEN `7-Eleven`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Guardian`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cold Storage`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `CS Fresh`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Giant`                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Jasons Deli`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SingtelShop!`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singtel Exclusive Retailer` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Gojek Singapore`            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `foodpanda`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Charge+`                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `CHAGEE`                     THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                              FALSE

-- cl.10(a)'s items: Cold Storage, CS Fresh and Jasons are one item; Singtel is one.
GIVEN who IS A Merchant
GIVETH A Merchant
`the PAssion item of` who MEANS
    CONSIDER who
    WHEN `CS Fresh`                   THEN `Cold Storage`
    WHEN `Jasons Deli`                THEN `Cold Storage`
    WHEN `Singtel Exclusive Retailer` THEN `SingtelShop!`
    OTHERWISE                              who

GIVEN thing IS AN Item
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PAssion Appendix 1 lists the item as earning nothing` thing MEANS
    CONSIDER thing
    WHEN `A plastic bag`                                             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Tobacco or cigarettes`                                     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A delivery charge`                                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A service such as a mobile or EZ-Link reload`              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A cash-like item such as a SIM top-up voucher`             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A statutory service or product`                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A DFI voucher or magazine`                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A gift card or voucher being bought`                       THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Listed infant milk formula`                                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sushi or sashimi`                                          THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A lottery product, bill payment, top-up service or Qoo10 payment` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A foodpanda dine-in order`                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A pandago order`                                           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `An order on a corporate account`                           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A pandapay wallet top-up`                                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A pandapro subscription`                                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A discount, voucher, delivery fee, platform fee or rider tip` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A Singtel corporate plan or sign-up`                       THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A Singtel prepaid card top-up`                             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A Singtel bill payment`                                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `An order placed outside the merchant's own app`            THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                                                             FALSE

-- Outlets: 7-Eleven Transit Lounge T1 and T3, vending machines (from 1 December
-- 2025); Guardian Departure Transit Lounge East T1, Changi T3 and Budget Terminal.
GIVEN who IS A Merchant
      out IS AN Outlet
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PAssion Appendix 1 gives the merchant nothing at the outlet` who out MEANS
    (out EQUALS `An airport transit lounge or Budget Terminal outlet` AND (who EQUALS `7-Eleven` OR who EQUALS `Guardian`))
    OR (out EQUALS `A vending machine` AND who EQUALS `7-Eleven`)

GIVEN who IS A Merchant
      d IS A Descriptor
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PAssion Appendix 1 gives the merchant nothing for the description` who d MEANS
    (who EQUALS `foodpanda` OR who EQUALS `Gojek Singapore`) AND d EQUALS `PayPal`

GIVEN who IS A Merchant
      thing IS AN Item
      k IS A `Charge kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is a Singtel bill for the PAssion terms` who thing k MEANS
    (who EQUALS `SingtelShop!` OR who EQUALS `Singtel Exclusive Retailer`)
    AND (thing EQUALS `A Singtel bill payment`
         OR k EQUALS `Bill payment`
         OR k EQUALS `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`)

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`PAssion Appendix 1 carves out the purchase` p MEANS
    `PAssion Appendix 1 lists the item as earning nothing` (p's item)
    OR `PAssion Appendix 1 gives the merchant nothing at the outlet` (p's merchant) (p's outlet)
    OR `PAssion Appendix 1 gives the merchant nothing for the description` (p's merchant) (p's descriptor)
    OR `the purchase is a Singtel bill for the PAssion terms` (p's merchant) (p's item) (p's `charge kind`)

-- cl.5(i): local currency spend made at a Participating Store (in Singapore),
-- not carved out by Appendix 1.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is local spend at a PAssion Participating Store` p MEANS
    `the merchant is a PAssion Participating Store` (p's merchant)
    AND p's `store location` EQUALS `A store in Singapore`
    AND p's currency EQUALS `Singapore dollars`
    AND NOT (`PAssion Appendix 1 carves out the purchase` p)

-- cl.5(ii), cl.10: Malaysian Ringgit retail spend.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is Malaysian Ringgit spend` p MEANS
    p's currency EQUALS `Malaysian ringgit`

-- The Singtel row (F-singtel-base): at a Singtel store the Base is not awarded.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is at a Singtel store` p MEANS
    p's merchant EQUALS `SingtelShop!` OR p's merchant EQUALS `Singtel Exclusive Retailer`


§§ `cl.9, cl.10 -- the points`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`PAssion Base yuu Points per S$1` MEANS 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
`PAssion Tier 1 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 at a store` MEANS 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
`PAssion Tier 1 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 on ringgit` MEANS 6

GIVETH A NUMBER
`PAssion Tier 2 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 at a store` MEANS 15

GIVETH A NUMBER
`PAssion Tier 2 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 on ringgit` MEANS 18

GIVETH A NUMBER
`PAssion Tier 1 POSB Bonus Points cap` MEANS 2000

GIVETH A NUMBER
`PAssion Tier 2 POSB Bonus Points cap` MEANS 7600

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion minimum Qualified Spend in S$` MEANS 500

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion Tier 1 minimum items` MEANS 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion Tier 2 minimum items` MEANS 5

-- cl.12 / the yuu Rewards Club: a yuu Point is S$0.005 and 0.28 miles "or more"
-- (the DBS yuu terms cl.12; the PAssion terms state no conversion of their own).
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the S$ value of one yuu Point for PAssion` MEANS 0.005

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the miles at least per yuu Point for PAssion` MEANS 0.28

-- The tier the month has reached with this purchase counted: 2, 1 or 0.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion tier reached with` p `in the month` m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (`the Qualified Spend with this purchase` p m) AT LEAST `the PAssion minimum Qualified Spend in S$` AND (`the number of PAssion items with this purchase` p m) AT LEAST `the PAssion Tier 2 minimum items`
            THEN 2
        IF (`the Qualified Spend with this purchase` p m) AT LEAST `the PAssion minimum Qualified Spend in S$` AND (`the number of PAssion items with this purchase` p m) AT LEAST `the PAssion Tier 1 minimum items`
            THEN 1
        OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Qualified Spend with this purchase` p m MEANS
    (m's `Qualified Spend`) PLUS (IF `the purchase is PAssion Qualified Spend` p THEN p's `amount in SGD` ELSE 0)

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of PAssion items with this purchase` p m MEANS
    (count (nub (map `the PAssion item of` (filter `the merchant is a PAssion Participating Store` (m's `items transacted`)))))
    PLUS (IF m's `ringgit spend made` THEN 1 ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `this purchase adds a new PAssion item to` m p THEN 1 ELSE 0)

-- A purchase adds an item if it is Bonus Eligible Spend of a kind not yet hit.
GIVEN m IS A `PAssion month`
      p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`this purchase adds a new PAssion item to` m p MEANS
    IF `the purchase is Malaysian Ringgit spend` p
    THEN NOT (m's `ringgit spend made`)
    ELSE `the purchase is local spend at a PAssion Participating Store` p
         AND NOT (elem (`the PAssion item of` (p's merchant)) (map `the PAssion item of` (m's `items transacted`)))

GIVEN tier IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion Bonus Points cap at tier` tier MEANS
    IF tier EQUALS 2 THEN `PAssion Tier 2 POSB Bonus Points cap` ELSE `PAssion Tier 1 POSB Bonus Points cap`

GIVEN tier IS A NUMBER
      p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion Bonus Points per S$1 at tier` tier `on` p MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF tier EQUALS 0
            THEN 0
        IF `the purchase is Malaysian Ringgit spend` p
            THEN IF tier EQUALS 2 THEN `PAssion Tier 2 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 on ringgit` ELSE `PAssion Tier 1 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 on ringgit`
        IF `the purchase is local spend at a PAssion Participating Store` p
            THEN IF tier EQUALS 2 THEN `PAssion Tier 2 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 at a store` ELSE `PAssion Tier 1 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 at a store`
        OTHERWISE 0

-- The bonus points at a tier, with the cap at that tier.
GIVEN tier IS A NUMBER
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion Bonus Points at tier` tier `on` p `in the month` m MEANS
    min ((`the PAssion Bonus Points per S$1 at tier` tier `on` p) TIMES (p's `amount in SGD`))
        (`at least nothing` ((`the PAssion Bonus Points cap at tier` tier) MINUS (m's `POSB Bonus Points earned`)))

-- Base Points: 3X on local spend at a Participating Store, none at Singtel stores
-- (the row), and on ringgit only on the second reading of F-passion-myr-base.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion Base Points on` p MEANS
    IF `the purchase is local spend at a PAssion Participating Store` p AND NOT (`the purchase is at a Singtel store` p)
    THEN `PAssion Base yuu Points per S$1` TIMES (p's `amount in SGD`)
    ELSE 0

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion Base Points on ringgit under the second reading` p MEANS
    IF `the purchase is Malaysian Ringgit spend` p
    THEN `PAssion Base yuu Points per S$1` TIMES (p's `amount in SGD`)
    ELSE 0


§§ `The answer`

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion certain points` c p m MEANS
    (`the PAssion Base Points on` p)
    PLUS (`the PAssion Bonus Points at tier` (`the PAssion tier reached with` p `in the month` m) `on` p `in the month` m)

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the PAssion best points` c p m MEANS
    (`the PAssion Base Points on` p)
    PLUS (`the PAssion Base Points on ringgit under the second reading` p)
    PLUS (`the PAssion Bonus Points at tier` 2 `on` p `in the month` m)

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH A LIST OF Condition
`PAssion conditions for` c p m MEANS
    append (IF `the PAssion tier reached with` p `in the month` m EQUALS 2 THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `PAssion: S$500 of Qualified Spend and the Tier items by month end`)
           (IF `the purchase is Malaysian Ringgit spend` p THEN LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)` ELSE EMPTY)

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`PAssion answer when the facts are settled` c p m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the purchase is inside the PAssion Promotion Period` p)
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `yuu Points` `per` "PAssion T&C cl.3: outside the Promotion Period (1 October 2025 to 31 December 2026)"
        IF NOT (`the purchase is PAssion Qualified Spend` p)
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `yuu Points` `per` "PAssion T&C cl.4"
        IF NOT (`the purchase is local spend at a PAssion Participating Store` p OR `the purchase is Malaysian Ringgit spend` p)
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `yuu Points` `per` "PAssion T&C cl.5-6, Appendix 1: not Bonus Eligible Spend"
        OTHERWISE `the answer` (`an answer for` c `in` `yuu Points` `of` (`the PAssion certain points` c p m) `to` (`the PAssion best points` c p m) `wanting` ((`the PAssion Bonus Points per S$1 at tier` 2 `on` p) TIMES (p's `amount in SGD`)) `at` (JUST `the miles at least per yuu Point for PAssion`) `excluded` FALSE `drawing on` `PAssion POSB bonus` `depending on` (`PAssion conditions for` c p m) `per` "PAssion T&C cl.8-10, cl.12") `valued in dollars at` `the S$ value of one yuu Point for PAssion`

GIVEN c IS A Card
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`PAssion earns nothing under the open reading` c MEANS
    `nothing is earned on` c `in` `yuu Points` `per` "PAssion T&C Appendix 1 (open reading)"

`a PAssion code that is excluded` MEANS 4829
`a PAssion code that is not excluded` MEANS 5411

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `PAssion month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`POSB PAssion earns on` c p m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the code is unknown for` p
            THEN `bracketed from` (`PAssion answer when the facts are settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a PAssion code that is excluded`) m) `to` (`PAssion answer when the facts are settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a PAssion code that is not excluded`) m) `adding` (LIST `The merchant category code is not known`)
        IF `the purchase is at a Singtel store` p AND NOT (`PAssion Appendix 1 carves out the purchase` p)
            THEN `bracketed from` (`PAssion earns nothing under the open reading` c) `to` (`PAssion answer when the facts are settled` c p m) `adding` (LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)
        OTHERWISE `PAssion answer when the facts are settled` c p m


§§ `The clock the PAssion POSB bonus pot runs on`

-- cl.7 ("each calendar month") and cl.10; the date a transaction counts by is not stated beyond "posted".
GIVETH A `Period basis`
`the PAssion POSB bonus pot's period` MEANS `Calendar month`

GIVETH A `Date basis`
`the PAssion POSB bonus pot's date basis` MEANS `Not stated in the document`

#ASSERT `the PAssion POSB bonus pot's period` EQUALS `Calendar month`
#ASSERT `the PAssion POSB bonus pot's date basis` EQUALS `Not stated in the document`


§§ `Illustrations`

GIVEN qualified IS A NUMBER
      hits IS A LIST OF Merchant
      ringgit IS A BOOLEAN
      bonus IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `PAssion month`
`a PAssion month with` qualified `of Qualified Spend, items` hits `, ringgit` ringgit `and` bonus `POSB Bonus Points` MEANS
    `PAssion month` WITH
        `Qualified Spend`           IS qualified
        `items transacted`          IS hits
        `ringgit spend made`        IS ringgit
        `POSB Bonus Points earned`  IS bonus

`a fresh PAssion month` MEANS `a PAssion month with` 0 `of Qualified Spend, items` EMPTY `, ringgit` FALSE `and` 0 `POSB Bonus Points`
`a PAssion month at S$480 with four items` MEANS `a PAssion month with` 480 `of Qualified Spend, items` (LIST `Cold Storage`, `Giant`, `Guardian`, `7-Eleven`) `, ringgit` FALSE `and` 0 `POSB Bonus Points`
`a PAssion month at S$480 with two items` MEANS `a PAssion month with` 480 `of Qualified Spend, items` (LIST `Cold Storage`, `Giant`) `, ringgit` FALSE `and` 0 `POSB Bonus Points`

`the PAssion card` MEANS `POSB PAssion Debit`

`S$20 at Gojek` MEANS `purchase for` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 4121) `Gojek Singapore`) 20
`S$10 at Cold Storage` MEANS `purchase for` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5411) `Cold Storage`) 10
`S$100 in ringgit` MEANS `purchase in currency` (`purchase at location` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5812) `A store outside Singapore`) `Malaysian ringgit`
`S$2 SimplyGo fare` MEANS `purchase for` (`purchase of item` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 4111) `SimplyGo`) `A SimplyGo bus or train fare`) 2
`S$100 at an unnamed shop` MEANS `purchase for` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5311) 100

-- cl.9: Base 3X on every S$1: S$10 at Cold Storage earns 30 yuu Points (a fresh month: no Bonus certain).
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$10 at Cold Storage` `a fresh PAssion month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 30
-- ... Tier 2 ceiling: 3 + 15 = 18 per S$1: 180.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$10 at Cold Storage` `a fresh PAssion month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 180
#ASSERT elem `PAssion: S$500 of Qualified Spend and the Tier items by month end` ((`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$10 at Cold Storage` `a fresh PAssion month`)'s `depends on`)
-- ... 0.28 miles "or more": the ceiling is 180 x 0.28 = 50.4 miles = 5.04 mpd.
#ASSERT fromMaybe 0 ((`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$10 at Cold Storage` `a fresh PAssion month`)'s `miles at best`) EQUALS 50.4
-- cl.12: yuu Points to two decimal places: S$1.50 at 3X is 4.50.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` (`purchase for` `S$10 at Cold Storage` 1.5) `a fresh PAssion month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 4.5

-- cl.10, Tier 1: S$480 + S$20 = S$500 and three items (Cold Storage, Giant, + Gojek): Tier 1 3X: Base 60 + Bonus 60 = 120 certain; Tier 2 needs 5 items.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$20 at Gojek` `a PAssion month at S$480 with two items`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 120
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$20 at Gojek` `a PAssion month at S$480 with two items`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 360
-- ... Tier 2: four items already + Gojek = five items, S$500: 3 + 15 = 18 per S$1: 360, certain.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$20 at Gojek` `a PAssion month at S$480 with four items`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 360
#ASSERT NOT (elem `PAssion: S$500 of Qualified Spend and the Tier items by month end` ((`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$20 at Gojek` `a PAssion month at S$480 with four items`)'s `depends on`))
-- ... a repeat of an item already hit does not add: Cold Storage again on the four-item month.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` (`purchase for` `S$10 at Cold Storage` 20) `a PAssion month at S$480 with four items`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 120
-- ... CS Fresh and Jasons Deli are the same item as Cold Storage.
#ASSERT `the number of PAssion items with this purchase` `S$10 at Cold Storage` (`a PAssion month with` 0 `of Qualified Spend, items` (LIST `CS Fresh`, `Jasons Deli`) `, ringgit` FALSE `and` 0 `POSB Bonus Points`) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the number of PAssion items with this purchase` `S$20 at Gojek` (`a PAssion month with` 0 `of Qualified Spend, items` (LIST `CS Fresh`, `Jasons Deli`) `, ringgit` TRUE `and` 0 `POSB Bonus Points`) EQUALS 3

-- cl.10(a): the caps. Tier 2: 7,600 yuu Points. With 7,590 earned, S$20 at Gojek on the four-item month: Base 60 + the 10 of room = 70.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$20 at Gojek` (`a PAssion month with` 480 `of Qualified Spend, items` (LIST `Cold Storage`, `Giant`, `Guardian`, `7-Eleven`) `, ringgit` FALSE `and` 7590 `POSB Bonus Points`))'s `units certain` EQUALS 70
-- ... with the cap full, the Base alone: 60.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$20 at Gojek` (`a PAssion month with` 480 `of Qualified Spend, items` (LIST `Cold Storage`, `Giant`, `Guardian`, `7-Eleven`) `, ringgit` FALSE `and` 7600 `POSB Bonus Points`))'s `units certain` EQUALS 60
-- ... the Tier 2 cap in dollars at 15X is 7,600 / 15 = S$506.67.
#ASSERT FLOOR (`PAssion Tier 2 POSB Bonus Points cap` DIVIDED BY `PAssion Tier 2 POSB Bonus Points per S$1 at a store`) EQUALS 506

-- cl.10: Malaysian Ringgit. Reading 1: the Tier bonus only (6X or 18X); Reading 2: also the 3X Base.
-- S$100 of ringgit spend on the four-item month at S$480 (ringgit is the fifth item; S$580 >= S$500): Tier 2: 18 x 100 = 1,800 certain; 2,100 at best.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$100 in ringgit` `a PAssion month at S$480 with four items`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 1800
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$100 in ringgit` `a PAssion month at S$480 with four items`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 2100
