-- ... on a fresh month the ringgit earns no Bonus for certain.
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$100 in ringgit` `a fresh PAssion month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`POSB PAssion earns on` `the PAssion card` `S$100 in ringgit` `a fresh PAssion month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 2100

