#ASSERT NOT (`the purchase is PAssion Qualified Spend` (`purchase described as` `S$10 at Cold Storage` `Youtrip`))
#ASSERT NOT (`the purchase is PAssion Qualified Spend` (`purchase with status` `S$10 at Cold Storage` `Authorised but not posted`))
#ASSERT `the purchase is PAssion Qualified Spend` `S$10 at Cold Storage`
